## IMPORTANT WORKOUT PROGRAMMING RULES

The six exercises above are a recommendation library, not a requirement to perform every listed exercise at maximum volume.

The default displayed plan must contain exactly six exercises per training day, but make the workload suitable for beginners.

Provide sensible default sets and reps, with options to reduce training volume.

Explain that the user's requested split is a preference and that a single-muscle-day split is not mandatory for muscle growth.

Because Thursday's triceps session precedes Friday's shoulder pressing, include recovery guidance and offer a triceps-friendly shoulder alternative when necessary.

Use conservative progression and never encourage training through pain.

If the user reports an injury or persistent pain, recommend professional evaluation rather than attempting to diagnose or treat it.

